  "_comment": [
    "Curated FIBA national-team squads: [player, positions, ratingIfNotInNBA].",
    "Ratings are left null for NBA players and resolved from the NBA 2K export at",
    "build time (real 1-99 overalls). Players outside the NBA carry a curated",
    "rating on the same scale, since no public dataset covers EuroLeague.",
    "",
    "Nationality is curated rather than taken from a dataset because FIBA squads",
    "are not NBA rosters: Serbia, Spain, Greece and Lithuania field mostly",
    "EuroLeague players, and eligibility follows the federation, not birthplace",
    "(Banchero plays for the USA rather than Italy).",
    "",
    "Keyed by ISO-3166 numeric id to match the map. Nations absent here field",
    "generated squads, shown dimmed and asterisked in game.",
    "",
    "Last checked against FIBA records in October 2026: every player has played",
    "for his national team since 2023, players who had retired from it were",
    "replaced by current internationals at the same position, and no five fields",
    "more than the one naturalized player FIBA allows.",
    "",
    "Positions: PG SG SF PF C. Most players cover two neighbouring positions,",
    "primary first (\"PG/SG\"); pure point guards and centres list one. Every",
    "listed position is one the player really plays, and every five has a player",
    "for each of the five positions, so the game's lineup optimiser fields it with",
    "nobody out of position (a PG/SG starts at either guard spot)."
  ],
